    {
      "kind": "request",
      "text": "Help me plan my study time for the Applied Data Ethics case memo over the next two weeks. Which deadline should we plan around? I have a module outline and a learning platform export. Check my calendar and ask what times work for me before making a proposal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "question",
      "id": "availability",
      "groupId": "a1-intake",
      "text": "Which days and time windows do you prefer for 1-hour study blocks for the case memo? Your calendar shows part-time work 08:00-12:00 weekdays, lunch 12:00-13:00, evening class Mon/Wed/Thu 18:30-21:30 with travel 17:30-18:30, but no preferred windows have been stated.",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "question",
      "id": "workload",
      "groupId": "a1-intake",
      "text": "What is your weekly study goal, maximum number of 1-hour blocks per day, break length in minutes between blocks, and final target completion date before the 2026-12-01 17:30 deadline?",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "questionId": "availability",
      "text": "For these two weeks, Wednesday, Thursday and Friday from 14:00 to 16:15 can work when the calendar is clear. I prefer to keep the weekend open."
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "questionId": "workload",
      "text": "Four study hours a week feels workable, with no more than two sessions a day and a 15-minute break between them."
    },
    {
